sequenceDiagram
    participant C as client
    participant S as server
    loop every 5s
        C->>S: poll
        alt has work
            S-->>C: job
        else idle
            S-->>C: nothing
        end
    end
    opt shutting down
        C->>S: bye
    end
    par fan out
        S->>C: event A
    and
        S->>C: event B
    end
    activate S
    Note right of S: busy
    deactivate S
    Note left of C: done
